# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) are official extension packages that provide specialized quantum computing algorithms and techniques.\n"
msgstr "Ang [Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) ay mga opisyal na extension package na nagbibigay ng mga espesyalisadong quantum computing algorithm at teknik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tutorials here {#tutorials-here}"
msgstr "Mga tutorial dito {#tutorials-here}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Addon | Package | Description |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Reduce circuit width by cutting gates, and find cuts automatically |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Addon | Package | Paglalarawan |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Bawasan ang width ng circuit sa pamamagitan ng pag-cut ng mga gate, at awtomatikong maghanap ng mga cut |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum's documentation no longer has guides for this addon, and no IBM tutorial covers these two. They come from the addon's GitHub repository and may be outdated. They can be executed directly in your browser using Binder, or on your own Jupyter server.\n"
msgstr "Wala nang mga gabay para sa addon na ito ang dokumentasyon ng IBM Quantum, at walang IBM tutorial na sumasaklaw sa dalawang ito. Galing ang mga ito sa GitHub repository ng addon at maaaring luma na. Maaari silang patakbuhin nang direkta sa browser mo gamit ang Binder, o sa sarili mong Jupyter server.\n"

